ted market. Its founders came through periods at Credit\nSuisse and Societe Generale SA, including the latter’s calamitous episode with rogue\ntrader Jerome Kerviel.', 'start_pos': None, 'end_pos': None, 'bbox': {'page': 2, 'x': 0.0, 'y': 0.0, 'width': 595.32, 'height': 841.92, 'selector': None, 'xpath': None, 'offset': None, 'line_start': None, 'line_end': None, 'char_start': None, 'char_end': None}, 'metadata': {'page_number': 2, 'page_width': 595.32, 'page_height': 841.92, 'has_embedding': True}, 'id': 'chunk_116bfc76-d9ca-4164-b677-253e452eb49a_1', 'embedding': [-0.02760092, -0.012479999, -0.00752801, -0.08191538, 0.019975815, -0.019451022, 0.013598752, 0.013363719, -0.0010274206, 0.013975928, -0.021536134, -0.00656163, 0.016220942, 0.0062675, 0.12995823, 0.04228586, 0.005560591, 0.0075411205, 0.011600023, 0.0044424566, 0.029688634, 0.0073060147, 0.0007282603, 0.008865284, -0.0013779526, -0.013033964, -0.009713271, -0.014300993, 0.019329363, -0.0007448576, 0.007595999, 0.0035611861, -0.008535624, 0.032965392, -0.0049822167, 0.022052312, -0.00068554503, -0.021625986, -0.009127557, 0.038054425, -0.008859142, -0.02153111, 0.005257281, 0.03172122, -0.04029428, -0.030194638, 0.01637079, -0.030233897, 0.021214452, 0.02511052, -0.02093408, 0.00054875965, 0.00662455, -0.15156718, 0.01773423, 0.031244654, 0.0016402992, -0.0030772265, 0.03219324, 0.028843889, 0.015284542, 0.002075511, -0.011309566, -0.018463634, -0.030292908, -0.05444091, 0.018330742, -0.024850871, -0.00649018, -0.0025355716, 0.017685568, -0.0027871472, -0.025437223, -0.027892213, 0.0030951528, -0.019988077, 0.013727285, 0.030550579, -0.0029475533, -0.008466587, 0.015393075, -0.04359896, 0.011673811, -0.011059893, -0.017419755, 0.00048110535, -0.010358239, -0.021416783, 0.029614357, 0.0004745891, -0.017225105, -0.014146828, -0.004886448, 0.0011514181, 0.006046084, -0.005609931, 0.015377768, 0.032473788, 0.0042405073, -0.002539619, -0.02701869, -0.048917472, -0.010747532, 0.009318375, -0.012597571, -0.0035